{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>掛畫框、校正電視水平、檢查牆身是否平整，或驗證樁柱是否垂直，都需要可靠的量度工具。《Smart Bubble Level》把十款高精度硬件工具整合於單一應用，適閤家居維修、DIY 愛好者、木工及建築人員使用；原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-106.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>十款量度工具一應俱全</h2>\n<p>應用內置三向氣泡水平儀，同時顯示橫向、縱向與圓形水平指示，另備鉛垂線、傾斜補償數碼指南針與雙軸測斜儀，實時量度斜率及俯仰角度。卡尺量尺、金屬探測、螢幕量角器、螢幕電筒與工程單位換算一應俱全，到達 0.0° 時更會發出聲響與震動提示。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-354-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-355-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-356-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-357-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-358-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-359-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Smart Bubble Level: Clinometer</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/smart-bubble-level-clinometer/id6783734557?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:01:44.311781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:44.710389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:40.262599+00:00","content_hash":"5a1eb72dddaa11e28fba53d863805a63ed0a47f7417eff401261c131233b6687","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}